{"game": "risk-of-rain-2013", "language": "english", "appid": 248820, "month": "2018-07", "window": 2, "start_date": 1531008000, "end_date": 1531699199, "month_true_total": 128, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 09:14:53 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "43553570", "author": {"steamid": "76561198273725418", "personaname": "SKADRIL", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/TheSKADRIL/", "num_games_owned": 822, "num_reviews": 40, "playtime_forever": 696, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 262, "last_played": 1699745478, "avatar": "7f96125ea6a8270666f13af4a10cde3aae816f5c"}, "language": "english", "review": "[b]Your progression will not save after death if you are playing on the easiest difficulty. To save your progression, you have to play the game the way it's meant to be played, playing on the harder difficulties.[/b]\n\nEasy to pick up but hard to master. Easily one of the best Rogue-Likes out there. A must have if you're an advocate of this genre, or even a new-commer.", "timestamp_created": 1531689897, "timestamp_updated": 1531689897, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 6, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.595505654811859131", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "43550582", "author": {"steamid": "76561198004791523", "personaname": "eMka", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/anotherstarkbitesthedust/", "num_games_owned": 399, "num_reviews": 17, "playtime_forever": 1614, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1438, "last_played": 1541794375, "avatar": "509d9f149f37889f697bcbdf38a1354e487029d7"}, "language": "english", "review": "I rate this higher than Spelunky & Rogue Legacy and lower than Necrodancer & Isaac", "timestamp_created": 1531678798, "timestamp_updated": 1531678798, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "43540731", "author": {"steamid": "76561198031502808", "personaname": "ant", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/wiccafolknightmare/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 2980, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2575, "last_played": 1607878009, "avatar": "1c2d419237faaf48da22f18000aa32624c8d7e09"}, "language": "english", "review": "Amazeballs. You may find yourself wanting to play a quick skirmish (if you're a filthy casual like me), however you ultimately end up doing an intense 2+ hours looped run. Seriously, the game has tremendous replayability value and is super fun with friends. Great soundtrack too. I got it on sale and I can't recommend it enough.", "timestamp_created": 1531641217, "timestamp_updated": 1542849975, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.505185186862945557", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "43539798", "author": {"steamid": "76561198312313717", "personaname": "Berry boi", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198312313717/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 2248, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 893, "last_played": 1546738443, "avatar": "807992b5d3554935aa61978e6813855055803c1c"}, "language": "english", "review": "pls give this game a better mutliplayer system this one is too complicated \n\nthe game is amazing but the multiplayer is just sad :/", "timestamp_created": 1531636721, "timestamp_updated": 1531636721, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "43526638", "author": {"steamid": "76561197962924680", "personaname": "TheWizard", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197962924680/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 3127, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2983, "last_played": 1577301676, "avatar": "59c44e9fd823b56a4fb3ebe6229ec7f29aacea6c"}, "language": "english", "review": "Recent bugs make this game practically unplayable.  Currently there are bugs which result in no progress or options being saved even when not in Drizzle mode.  Because this game relies on unlocks to get new characters and items, this completely breaks the game.  It appears to be a problem with the game not properly writing/reading the .ini files.  There are no reliable fixes on the forums (I've tried them all)\n\nThe game itself can be quite fun, if with a steep difficulty curve.  You have to play fast and balance moving forward with gathering items.  It's a fun little rogue-like shooter, but given the bugs I'd stay away.", "timestamp_created": 1531581120, "timestamp_updated": 1531581120, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.458015263080596924", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}]}